  "dcterms:description": "ToxValDB (v9.7.0), a comprehensive database of toxicity values compiled by the U.S. EPA, aggregating ~249,000 point-of-departure and derived toxicity records (LD50, NOAEL, LOAEL, RfD, cancer potency factors, etc.) across ~41,855 chemicals from 51 sources. This brick downloads the ToxValDB v9.7.0 Release from Zenodo record 17088058 and standardizes the summary files into a single parquet keyed by DTXSID/CASRN.",
